{"title":"What should I ask Cass Sunstein?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/924778394/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Cass-Sunstein.html","date":1757789129000,"content":"<p>Yes, I will be doing a Conversation with him soon.  Most of all (but not <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I%27m_Not_There\" target=\"_blank\">exclusively</a>) about his three recent books <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Liberalism-Defense-Cass-R-Sunstein/dp/0262049775/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1YPN7BHOG3HC2&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.9fIHNZN9mzYTxARye_RTo3_xujlolcseYj7Kh6VWpGdWEIkZclkteUBECz42sAQnlVBr3c2W8wMqeJAqKYEVlgwrp-YWq6fQugzFa7smssmDLmlcYgsSKkt6tsQuOHzGQD6CEXWhCW0K8v-gMdgZDD39XVvvvaAHpg9EUjn8sMFxCncjLUPcbyGRt6iVcoSdYF9w-JqYGQCZxPCOYivekvsgi7HvrZouN3846j1jcvHfx383wbOoUIQTZ80eAj4ghD0saMheZPt3t4CVovWQbi2889a7YnlDyxuo8HZfkYk.B6yFZIrjMgWtBWMBGoiP5fxAAKJ3BWE9R24nydNSlSE&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=cass+sunstein&amp;qid=1757788911&amp;sprefix=cass+sunstein%2Caps%2C96&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Liberalism: In Defense of Freedom</a>, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Manipulation-What-Why-Its-About/dp/1009620215/ref=sr_1_2?crid=1YPN7BHOG3HC2&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.9fIHNZN9mzYTxARye_RTo3_xujlolcseYj7Kh6VWpGdcvTy4Qg8ea7RGL-aYnOnXsz5TI0i9RVRR0L3d2-0g9QcZ1vu9d-Z-RE6vha9PLPCDLmlcYgsSKkt6tsQuOHzGQD6CEXWhCW0K8v-gMdgZDD39XVvvvaAHpg9EUjn8sMFX7Px0qKrBuMfXFMDzk4c9LVWFfvCaBep0AiMBnqQQvY1TyI0hI5DxalbkdXQqyrG5y7sQaDfjBSqPgfKiI58sVf-gWvG5kgEgHAxBpas6kS2889a7YnlDyxuo8HZfkYk.RttkvMdZ9sjdNCSt0uh95a089qR5XMMbDBoR5VxIdvw&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=cass+sunstein&amp;qid=1757788941&amp;sprefix=cass+sunstein%2Caps%2C96&amp;sr=8-2\" target=\"_blank\">Manipulation: What It Is, Why It Is Bad, What To Do About It</a>, and <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Imperfect-Oracle-What-Can-Cannot/dp/16061813